  "body": "## What changed\n\n**Stacked on #646** (#637 step A). Merge #646 first. This is **#637 step B**, option 2 from the design comment on #637.\n\n**New `SdfField::floor_at(x, y) -> FloorRead`** (`crates/sim/src/stock_sim/field_floor.rs`) reads the **lowest face of the stock under a column**.\n- **How:** straight from the shell's own lowest crossing on that column. That's a mesh plane, so it's **exact**.\n- **Why:** it's the column body's commonest re-clamp, a part flipped onto a face an earlier setup left uncut.\n- **What it refuses:** a column whose floor a cut actually removed (a claim > 0 at or next to the floor cell) gets **`FloorRead::CutFromBelow`**, by name. The down-march's exactness rests on `cut_ups`, and no upward companion exists yet, so no bracketed guess is given. A `cut_downs` companion (option 1) can lift this later.\n- **Other results:** `NoMaterial` for a column beside the stock, `Unreadable` for an `Open` parity column.\n- **Not yet wired:** nothing uses it yet. It's for steps C–D.\n\n**Also folded in, from the review of #646:** the `unapply` doc now says the round trip is exact **to rounding** (exactly for integer shifts, within an ulp of a fractional one), not \"bit for bit\".\n\n## How tested\n\n- **New `crates/sim/tests/field_floor.rs`, 2/2:**\n  - `an_uncut_floor_reads_the_shell_exactly`: a plate's floor is −6.0 exactly. A shallow top slot leaves it −6.0, since a band reaching down isn't a cut floor. Beside the stock reads `NoMaterial`.\n  - `a_floor_a_cut_reached_is_refused_by_name`: a slot cut through the plate gives `CutFromBelow` over the slot, and the floor beside it is still exactly −6.0.\n- **`scripts/gate.sh quick`:** the sim suites pass. Named: field_carry 3, stock_backend_parity 13, stock_columns 3, and app setup_carry 9, carried_verify 8.\n- **Clippy** on sim and app with `-D warnings`: clean. No golden changed.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nSteps C–E (the clip intersection, the body enum with its agreement lane, and the app holders), per #637.\n\nChangelog: none (internal: a field floor read, not yet used)\n\nRefs #637\nRefs #26\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX\n",
